      "message": "Inspection of this function shows that it does not check the temporal_id and spatial_id of the metadata OBU. Therefore the decoder cannot possibly attach a layer-specific metadata OBU to a decoded frame with the same temporal_id and spatial_id. If the next frame after a layer-specific metadata OBU has a different temporal_id or spatial_id, the metadata OBU will be attached to the wrong frame.",
